{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00019","headline":"怨词二首 · 崔国辅","name":"怨词二首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾有罗衣裳，秦王在时作。为舞春风多，秋来不堪著。 楼头桃李疏，池上芙蓉落。织锦犹未成，蛩声入罗幕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「怨词二首」条，撰者周啸天、与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周啸天"}